# SFA UI Design Standards

## Goal
Clean **pharma enterprise** UI — modern teal/slate palette, simple layouts, **mobile-friendly** (MR/manager use phones + laptops).

## Theme (do not override per page)
- Tokens live in `apps/web/src/theme/sfa-theme.ts` + `apps/web/src/index.css` (`--sfa-*`)
- Primary `#0891b2`, background `#f1f5f9`, surface `#ffffff`, text `#0f172a`
- Change colors only in theme file — never one-off hex in feature pages

## MUST (every new/changed screen)
- **Shell:** `DashboardShell` — desktop sidebar, mobile drawer menu (`Grid.useBreakpoint`, `< md` = mobile)
- **Layout:** wrap pages in `PageLayout` + `PageSection` from `apps/web/src/components/ui/`
- **Tables:** use `ResponsiveTable` (horizontal scroll + compact rows on mobile)
- **Forms:** `layout="vertical"`, fields in `.form-grid` (1 col mobile, auto-fit desktop)
- **Grids:** Ant `Row`/`Col` with `xs={12}` or `xs={24}` — never fixed `span={6}` without breakpoints
- **States:** loading (`Spin`), empty (`Empty`), error toast — no blank screens
- **i18n:** all labels/buttons via `useI18n().t()` — en / hi / hinglish
- **Touch:** min control height 40px; action buttons use `Space wrap` on narrow screens
- **A11y:** labels on inputs; visible focus; WCAG AA contrast

## MUST NOT
- Inline `style={{ … }}` for layout/colors (except truly one-off)
- Raw `<table>` for new screens
- Desktop-only fixed sidebar without mobile drawer
- Hardcoded English strings
- 3+ font sizes on one page (title / body / caption only)

## Screen patterns
| Pattern | Structure |
|---------|-----------|
| Master / txn list | `PageLayout` → create `PageSection` → list `PageSection` + `ResponsiveTable` |
| Dashboard stats | `StatCard` in responsive `Row`/`Col` |
| Approval queue | `PageLayout` → `ResponsiveTable` + row actions |
| Auth | `.login-page` + `.login-card` (full width mobile, max 420px desktop) |

## When touching existing pages
Migrate to shared components when editing — do not leave old `Card`+`Typography.Title` stacks.
